{"4104510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Most Difficult Ball Game", "steam_appid": 4104510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Most Difficult Ball Game</strong> is not a normal Game — <br>it’s a <strong>physics experiment in pain, mastery, and gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t control the ball.<br><strong>You ARE the ball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only tool you have is your mouse.🖱️<br>Move left or right — the ball obeys… sometimes. 🙃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.poster.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.webm?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.mp4?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal physics-based movement</strong> ✔️<br>Every millimeter counts. Master momentum, friction, and gravity — or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints. No mercy.</strong> ✔️<br>One mistake sends you back to the beginning.<br>This game does not forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the ball.</strong> ✔️<br>No characters. No upgrades. No shortcuts.<br>Only control, patience, and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.poster.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.webm?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.mp4?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maybe the ball is not climbing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe every fall is a memory,<br>and every jump is a small rebellion<br>against gravity — and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you and the ball<br>are the same creature<br>in two shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speedrun-ready</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant retries. Instant failure.<br>Learn fast — or rage faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/cef7bd786bf70060a478e8adb3ede63a.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1560 height=481 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play This Game?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You like difficult physics games</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You enjoy mastering impossible mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You want a game that feels <i>earned</i> when you beat it</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You enjoy learning through failure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You hate yourself (just a little)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why NOT Play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ You fear gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ You dislike rage-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ Your mouse is expensive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Most Difficult Ball Game</strong> is not a normal Game — <br>it’s a <strong>physics experiment in pain, mastery, and gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t control the ball.<br><strong>You ARE the ball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only tool you have is your mouse.🖱️<br>Move left or right — the ball obeys… sometimes. 🙃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.poster.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.webm?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/668863ce456791293b3ec82f5d102ffa.mp4?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal physics-based movement</strong> ✔️<br>Every millimeter counts. Master momentum, friction, and gravity — or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints. No mercy.</strong> ✔️<br>One mistake sends you back to the beginning.<br>This game does not forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the ball.</strong> ✔️<br>No characters. No upgrades. No shortcuts.<br>Only control, patience, and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.poster.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.webm?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/44f85c74a4982bc3c5b13c97526af147.mp4?t=1769756919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maybe the ball is not climbing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe every fall is a memory,<br>and every jump is a small rebellion<br>against gravity — and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you and the ball<br>are the same creature<br>in two shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speedrun-ready</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant retries. Instant failure.<br>Learn fast — or rage faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104510/extras/cef7bd786bf70060a478e8adb3ede63a.avif?t=1769756919\" width=1560 height=481 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play This Game?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You like difficult physics games</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You enjoy mastering impossible mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You want a game that feels <i>earned</i> when you beat it</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ You enjoy learning through failure</p></li></ul>